{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38519","headline":"送于员外归隐蓝田 · 吴融","name":"送于员外归隐蓝田","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曾吟工部两峰寒，今日星郎得挂冠。\n吾道不行归始是，世情如此住应难。\n围棋已访生云石，把钓先寻急雨滩。\n若遇秦时雪髯客，紫芝兼可备朝餐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38519.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38519","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}